{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105632","id":2472229493,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6TWzp1","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105632","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105632.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105632.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105632","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105632/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105632/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105632/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bde30a84d91396692a8edc0086743ad651f60ae7","number":105632,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Implement global `deep_equals` function","user":{"login":"Geometror","id":50084500,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDg0NTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50084500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror","html_url":"https://github.com/Geometror","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"![grafik](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7bcbf833-5609-495b-9f0f-738d3e0f1ccc)\r\n\r\nA deep equality check for all variant types is something I have long missed, so this PR implements it - and I'm sure I'm not the only one. (I needed to implement this for most of my projects)\r\nSince this is an essential feature, addressing a need discussed several times in forums etc., but never formally tracked, I allowed myself to directly implement this without a proposal. Well, and while it works in GDScript, it's much slower than a native solution. In addition, implementing this yourself can be error-prone, so the goal of this PR is to provide a solid implementation that behaves expectedly.\r\nBut if a formal proposal is desired, I could create one.\r\n\r\nIncludes unit tests.\r\n\r\n# How it works\r\n\r\n- Compares basic types using `==` \r\n- Compares `Object`, `Dictionary` and `Array` recursively\r\n\t- Compares arrays element wise (like `==`)\r\n\t- Compares dictionaries order-independently\r\n\t- Compares objects by their properties (which includes metadata) order-independently\r\n\r\n# Why another function?\r\n\r\n## `is_same`\r\n\"Returns `true`, for value types, if `a` and `b` share the same value. Returns `true`, for reference types, if the references of `a` and `b` are the same.\" (quoted from docs)\r\n(`is_same` uses the `==` operator for `Object`s, so they are compared by object ID)\r\n\r\n## `==` and `recursive_equal`\r\n- the `==` operator uses `Variant::hash_compare` which calls `recursive_equal` (only exposed for `Dictionary`) on `Array` and `Dictionary`, whereby `Object`s are compared by reference (object ID)\r\n- Changing the behavior of `==` for `Object`s would be a massive compat-breakage (so we can't just modify `Variant::hash_compare`)\r\n\r\nThere is no way to do a predictable deep equality check when using the hash function (since for object two content-equal object have different hashes), so I went with a predictable and solid deep equality check\r\n\r\n# Remarks & Discussion\r\n\r\n~~- Should it be named something like `deep_equals` to make its purpose clearer?~~ Yes :)","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5793,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22